## Requests and terms

Send a personal request to Ben Korbel at ben@internetofhappiness.org with the applicant's name, organisation, intended use, requested modifications, research or commercial context, and relevant revenue information. Do not include confidential datasets or credentials in a public issue. A written approval or agreement defines the actual permission granted.

The material is supplied as available, without a warranty of fitness for a particular purpose, subject to applicable law and any separate written agreement. Research prototypes and demonstrations do not establish clinical efficacy or validated biological findings. No right to use the licensor's names or branding as an endorsement is granted.
